[TITLE]
SIM-19: reservoir R1 feeds J2 (100 gpm) through pipe P1 and GPV V1
V1 uses head loss curve C1 in the file. The test switches it to C2 through the toolkit.

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID   Elev  Demand
 J1   0     0
 J2   0     100

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID   Head
 R1   100

[PIPES]
;ID  N1  N2  Length  Diam  Rough  Mloss  Status
 P1  R1  J1  1000    12    100    0      Open

[VALVES]
;ID  N1  N2  Diam  Type  Setting
 V1  J1  J2  12    GPV   C1

[CURVES]
;ID  Flow (gpm)  HeadLoss (ft)
 C1  0           0
 C1  1000        10
 C2  0           0        ; 2 ft at 100 gpm
 C2  1000        20

[TIMES]
 Duration  0

[OPTIONS]
 Units     GPM
 Headloss  H-W

[END]
